      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Veigar is the greatest Evil to ever strike at the hearts of Runeterra - and he's only getting bigger! Striking an enemy Champion with a spell or scoring a takedown grants Veigar permanently increased Ability Power.",
      "summary_zh": "维迦是最强大的恶魔，甚至能对符文之地之心发起攻击——并且他只会越来越强大！用技能攻击一名敌人、击杀单位或拆毁防御塔都会为维迦永久提升法术强度加成。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1308708:3932550"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ability_id": "ability:Veigar:q:ddragon-16.16.1",
      "damage_types": [
        "magic"
      ],
      "detailed_description_zh": "维迦释放一束黑暗能量，对命中的头2个敌人造成【数值】魔法伤害。 用此技能击杀一个单位，还会为维迦提供【数值】层超凡邪恶效果。大型小兵和大型野怪会提供【数值】层作为替代。",
      "extraction": {
        "method": "deterministic_client_markup_v1",
