      "summary_en": "Veigar unleashes a bolt of dark energy that deals magic damage to the first two enemies hit. Units killed by this bolt grant Veigar some ability power permanently.",
      "summary_zh": "维迦释放一束黑暗能量，对最先被命中的两个敌人造成魔法伤害。被这个能量束所击杀的单位，会永久地为维迦提供一些法术强度。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1308709:4050924"
      ]
